{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22190","headline":"朝回游城南 · 白居易","name":"朝回游城南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝退马未困，秋初日犹长。\n回辔城南去，郊野正清凉。\n水竹夹小径，萦回绕川冈。\n仰看晚山色，俯弄秋泉光。\n青松系我马，白石爲我牀。\n常时簪组累，此日和身忘。\n旦随鵷鹭末，暮游鸥鹤旁。\n机心一以尽，两处不乱行。\n谁辨心与迹，非行亦非藏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22190.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22190","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}